# skills: Flora's Binding Rain (Water Bind on every enemy, each with its own roll, 13 MP) and its MP.
# Jian and Flora (party_flora), Flora at level 28 (level index 27 pinned), her MP NOT pinned (18), no
# roll forced. Round 1: Jian Fights; Flora's list (br_list on Binding Rain, the sixth entry), A casts
# with no picker: a ribbon on each enemy in turn (br_a to br_x), MP 18 -> 5 once, and each enemy's
# status goes to 4 or stays 0 with a MISS by its own roll. Round 2: Binding Rain is greyed and refused
# for lack of MP (br_no_mp).
# Battle records at 0x0228E860 (0x6C each: status in the low nibble of +0x08, HP +0x14, MP +0x18). Run with --save.
include party_flora
pin u32 0x020b4778 27
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
watch u32 0x0228e8e4 flora_mp
watch u8 0x0228ea18 status4
watch u8 0x0228ea84 status5
watch u8 0x0228eaf0 status6
watch u8 0x0228ebc8 status8
watch u8 0x0228ec34 status9
watch u8 0x0228eca0 status10
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press Down 8
wait 50
shot br_list
press A 8
wait 30
waituntil u32 0x0228e8e4 5 3000
wait 10
shot br_a
wait 10
shot br_b
wait 10
shot br_c
wait 10
shot br_d
wait 10
shot br_e
wait 10
